<title>HONG KONG: Harbour Ring 1996 net down 22.95 pct.</title>
<headline>Harbour Ring 1996 net down 22.95 pct.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-03-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended December 31</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   5.86     vs 7.58</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    1.5	vs 2.0</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  nil	vs nil</p>
<p>    Net			    100.83   vs 130.86</p>
<p>    Turnover		     1,743.60 vs 1,680.43</p>
<p>    Company name		 Harbour Ring International</p>
<p>				     Holdings Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  April 21-25</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   May 19</p>
<p>NOTE - Harbour Ring manufactures toys.</p>
<p>Total dividend for year is 2.5 H.K. cents (including interim dividend of one cent) vs four cents.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
